1
00:00:00,484 --> 00:00:03,944
(Sheldon:)...where when a hunter flaunts his success
to the rest of the village...

2
00:00:04,113 --> 00:00:08,243
(Sheldon:)...they kill him and drive away evil spirits
with a drum made of his skin.

3
00:00:08,409 --> 00:00:12,909
(Sheldon:)Superstitious nonsense, of course,
but one can see their point.

4
00:00:19,587 --> 00:00:22,507
(Penny(bringing another grasshopper):)Here you go, Raj.
You might wanna drink this one slowly.

5
00:00:22,673 --> 00:00:25,923
(Raj:)Okay. So Saturday night,
can I count on my posse?

6
00:00:26,093 --> 00:00:29,303
(Howard:)Gee, I'd love to, Raj, but I can't make it.

7
00:00:29,472 --> 00:00:30,892
(Raj:)Oh, okay. Leonard?

8
00:00:31,599 --> 00:00:33,139
(Leonard:)Well, uh...

9
00:00:33,726 --> 00:00:36,686
No, I could... No.

10
00:00:37,563 --> 00:00:40,943
(Leonard:)- Sheldon?
- I can make it, but I won't.

11
00:00:41,609 --> 00:00:45,399
- What are you talking about?
- The reception for my article on Saturday.

12
00:00:45,571 --> 00:00:46,611
(Penny:)You guys aren't going?

13
00:00:47,782 --> 00:00:50,912
(Penny:)I can't believe you. Raj is celebrating
a tremendous accomplishment.

14
00:00:51,077 --> 00:00:52,577
You're not gonna be there?

15
00:00:52,745 --> 00:00:56,205
(Sheldon:)A tremendous accomplishment would be
if the planetary body he discovered...

16
00:00:56,374 --> 00:01:01,024
(Sheldon:)...were plummeting toward Earth
and he exploded it with his mind.

